SUMMARY:Meet the Maker: Jefferson's Bourbon | Session II 
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 12 spots 
 left\nStatus: You are on Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse
 .com/events/206917\n\nJoin us for an intimate tasting experience with Jeff
 erson’s Bourbon\, exploring the craftsmanship\, character\, and creativi
 ty behind each pour. The evening begins with a welcome cocktail and time t
 o mingle before a guided tasting led by Jefferson’s founder Trey Zoeller
 . A Kentucky native with deep family ties to American whiskey\, Zoeller fo
 unded Jefferson’s with his father in 1997 and has become known for chall
 enging bourbon tradition through inventive approaches to aging and blendin
 g\, earning him a place in the Kentucky Bourbon Hall of Fame.\n\nAs straig
 ht tasting pours are passed\, Trey will share the story of Jefferson’s w
 hile guiding members through the flavor profiles\, production process\, an
 d distinctive character of each selection. Following the tasting\, the eve
 ning opens back up for conversation\, giving members the opportunity to mi
 ngle\, revisit their favorites\, and connect with Trey one-on-one for ques
 tions and a deeper dive into the world of Jefferson’s Bourbon.\n\n*This 
 event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary light 
 bites and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancellation
 s be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/206917
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
